<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$5 bln in NCDs on Thursday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$5 bln in NCDs on Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$5 billion in 11-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Thursday, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3.00 pm (0700 GMT), the official said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
